OL,3,ABaxters fish soup cans recalled over
OL,4,Afears they could 'swell and rupture'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCustomers who bought cans of a fish
OL,7,Fsoup manufactured by Baxters have been
OL,8,Furged to dispose of them in outside
OL,9,Fbins over fears the tins could burst.
OL,11,FThe firm has recalled its Chef
OL,12,FSelections Cullen Skink soup, a smoked
OL,13,Fhaddock chowder, due to a manufacturing
OL,14,Ffault which may cause it to spoil and
OL,15,Fcans to "swell and potentially
OL,16,Frupture", according to the Food
OL,17,FStandards Agency (FSA).
OL,19,FIf spoilt, the soup may have an
OL,20,F"unpleasant odour and flavour", the FSA
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
