OL,3,ABaxters fish soup cans recalled over
OL,4,Afears they could 'swell and rupture'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company, based in the north east of
OL,7,FScotland, said the issue may affect the
OL,8,F400g cans with batch code L07XC and an
OL,9,FApril 2029 best before date.
